# Chat tabs (Boss, 2026-10-30): the device label moves from the tab to the header, after the title and quieter than it
# (the title gives way first); a tab's name stops at 160 dp with an ellipsis. Fictional fixture: a phone thread, Mac
# threads on Mac Pro / MG1 / MacBook, one with a very long name. No agent or Mac is reached.
# canvas-app: soma-chat
fold folded
rotate portrait
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --ez tabWidth true
tap Show the tabs
expect Release notes
expect Last tab to scroll to
shot tab-width-strip-cover
# A thread with no machine shows no label.
tap 0.24 0.197
wait 500
shot tab-width-phone-cover card=soma-chat-chat-cover
# Mac thread with a long name: header shows the title (ellipsis) and the device label stays.
tap 0.55 0.197
wait 500
shot tab-width-long-name-cover card=soma-chat-chat-cover
# A Mac thread on another machine.
tap 0.80 0.197
wait 500
shot tab-width-mg1-cover card=soma-chat-chat-cover
# The last tab, past the strip's edge, is scrolled into view when opened.
swipe 0.85 0.21 0.05 0.21 500
tap 0.68 0.197
wait 500
shot tab-width-open-tab-in-view-cover
fold open
rotate landscape
wait 800
shot tab-width-strip-unfolded
tap 0.05 0.224
wait 500
shot tab-width-phone-unfolded card=soma-chat-chat
tap 0.28 0.224
wait 500
shot tab-width-long-name-unfolded card=soma-chat-chat
fold folded
rotate portrait
